msgstr "Beküldési paraméterek"

#: includes/settings/class-form-settings.php:247
#: includes/settings/class-form-settings.php:292
msgid ""
"Set the parameters that will be sent to Google Analytics for this feed."
msgstr "Állítsd be azokat a paramétereket, amelyeket ez az adatfolyam a Google Analyticsnek küld."

#: includes/settings/class-form-settings.php:250
#: includes/settings/class-form-settings.php:295
